# Build context is the repo root; the node image needs only the two Go/Rust
# services. Everything else is weight or, worse, a credential.
*
!services/hub
!services/claudemon
!deploy/fly/node
# Shared with the hub image, so they sit one level up rather than in either
# image's directory: the release download + verify (artifact mode) and the single
# writer of the build-stamp format (both modes). Build-time only — neither is
# copied into the finished image.
!deploy/fly/fetch-release.sh
!deploy/fly/write-build-stamp.sh

services/hub/hub
services/hub/brain
services/hub/mcp
services/hub/workspacer
services/hub/claudemon
services/hub/web
services/claudemon/target
services/claudemon/vitest-out.txt
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/*.log
